§§ `Rule 2 -- Matters for Judge in person (O. 48, r. 2)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 48 r 2(1) the kind of application to a Judge` IS ONE OF
    `o 48 r 2(1)(a) an application to decide on the challenge of an arbitrator under Article 13(3) of the Model Law`
    `o 48 r 2(1)(b) an application to decide on the termination of the mandate of an arbitrator under Article 14(1) of the Model Law`
    `o 48 r 2(1)(c) an application to appeal against the ruling of the arbitral tribunal under section 10 or Article 16(3) of the Model Law`
    `o 48 r 2(1)(d) an application to set aside an award under section 24 or Article 34(2) of the Model Law`
    `o 48 r 2(1) another kind of application`

