§§ `Rule 3 -- Matters for Judge or Registrar (O. 48, r. 3)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 48 r 3(1) the kind of application or request to the Court` IS ONE OF
    `o 48 r 3(1)(a) an application to hear an application in open court under section 22`
    `o 48 r 3(1)(b) an application for permission to enforce interim orders or directions of an arbitral tribunal under section 12(6)`
    `o 48 r 3(1)(c) an application for interim orders or directions under section 12A`
    `o 48 r 3(1)(d) an application to reinstate discontinued proceedings under section 6(4)`
    `o 48 r 3(1)(e) an application for permission to enforce an award under section 18 or 19`
    `o 48 r 3(1)(f) an application for permission to enforce a foreign award under section 29`
    `o 48 r 3(1) another kind of application`

